WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.253
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Word: Insert a Table and a Picture.

2
00:00:06.553 --> 00:00:11.156
Add a table and a picture to a document. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:14.709
Step one. Click the Insert tab.

4
00:00:15.717 --> 00:00:21.680
Step two. Click Table. Move the mouse over the squares and choose two columns and three rows.

5
00:00:22.683 --> 00:00:27.324
Step three. Click a cell and type. Press Tab to move to the next cell.

6
00:00:28.317 --> 00:00:35.627
Step four. To add a picture, click Pictures, find your photo and click Insert. Drag a corner to make it bigger or smaller.

7
00:00:36.617 --> 00:00:40.326
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:40.626 --> 00:00:43.600
Insert a table with 3 columns and 4 rows.

9
00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.819
Type your class timetable in it.

10
00:00:46.119 --> 00:00:48.234
Insert one picture below the table.

11
00:00:48.534 --> 00:00:49.640
Well done!

